    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes estate Agents are delighted to offer this unique property For Sale. Nestled in the tranquil countryside on the slopes of the Sliabh an Iarainn mountain on a site of 2.24 acres with breath-taking panoramic views, this unique property features two cottages (only 1 property can be used as the primary residence) offering both character and comfort & Ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat, investment opportunity, or a charming family home with ancillary space which could be used for guest accommodation/games rooms etc.\nThe rustic, original cottage, full of old-world charm, features a compact kitchen, living room, shower room, and 2 cosy bedrooms. Modest, and yet, peaceful, perfect for restful nights. Second residence- modernised cottage, fully renovated in 2021, bringing it up to newer standards, features an open-plan living room & kitchen, modern bathroom, 2 bright bedrooms up the stairs, with countryside views. Both properties include classic charming features like vintage doors, timeless woodwork, and a warm atmosphere. Situated midway between the towns of Ballinamore & Drumshanbo (approx 10km). Nature enthusiasts will appreciate Poll an Easa Waterfall, only 4.3 km walk away. Viewing Strictly by Appointment Only with Sole Selling Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Original cottage: \nKitchen/Dining room with solid fuel heating\nShower room\nLiving room\n2 smaller bedrooms\nStorage space in the attic.\n\nRenovated cottage:\nOpen plan kitchen / spacious living room solid fuel stove\nShower room\n2 bright bedrooms up stairs"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Original cottage with rustic features, built in 1899.\nConverted stone old house, renovated in 2021.\nLarge Glass Façade - floods the space with natural light and scenic views\nStone outbuildings\nSolid Fuel Stove\nGarden views"
      },
